{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d2214041-69ee-42ab-8b2a-d08000f1c1aa",
    "name": "Interview Platform — Phase 1 / S3 (Auth Spine) + Phase 3 (Lifecycle & Join)",
    "description": "Proves the auth spine of Phase 1: public health path, Keycloak password-grant login (token stored in a variable), and the protected endpoint through the gateway returning 401 without a token and 200 with it, with issuer and organization_id claim assertions. Then drives a Phase 3 interview through its full lifecycle (schedule -> regenerate link -> join-token validation -> lobby before/after admit -> reschedule -> cross-org 404 -> revoke link -> cancel) plus the reachable join-token refusal branches (NOT_FOUND, REVOKED, OUTSIDE_WINDOW).\n\nSecrets are pre-filled in Collection -> Variables (passwords equal the username):\n- recruiterAUsername / recruiterAPassword — org A recruiter 'recruiter1' / 'recruiter1'\n- recruiterBUsername / recruiterBPassword — org B recruiter 'recruiter2' / 'recruiter2'\n\nEverything else is concrete, read from keycloak/realm-export.json and MeController.java:\n- orgAId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111\n- orgBId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222\n- /api/me returns keys 'subject' and 'organizationId'\n- interview-web has directAccessGrantsEnabled=true (password grant works)\n- issuer is http://localhost:8180/realms/interview-platform in all three places\n\nDo NOT paste an access token by hand: the Auth requests set {{accessToken}} / {{accessTokenB}} in their test scripts.\n\nRun order (top to bottom, one click): Health -> Auth (sets tokens) -> Protected endpoint -> Phase 3.\n\nNote on Phase 3 join tokens: the validity window is [scheduledStart - 15 min, scheduledStart + 30 min]. The main interview is scheduled ~5 minutes in the future (via a pre-request script) so its token is valid while the public validate/lobby requests run; the OUTSIDE_WINDOW refusal uses a separate interview scheduled in the past. USED and EXPIRED are refusal branches in code but are NOT reachable via HTTP in this phase.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "46902495",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/46902495-d2214041-69ee-42ab-8b2a-d08000f1c1aa?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
